OL,3,ALindsay Clancy's lawyer asks judge to
OL,4,Aremove juror from murder trial after
OL,5,Atense exchange
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 36-year-old former nurse does not
OL,8,Fdispute killing her two sons and
OL,9,Fdaughter, but her lawyer argues she was
OL,10,Fsuffering from postpartum psychosis at
OL,11,Fthe time, and therefore could not
OL,12,Fdistinguish right from wrong
